{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011Cg6TGykBjTSbyBtLmipp9", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "```\nTable 3 reports the estimates, and identity matters. The coefficient on the identity-disclosed indicator is 0.18 (SE = 0.04) in column 2, and it remains substantial at 0.15 (SE = 0.05) in column 3 after we add product fixed effects. Reviewer tenure amplifies the effect: the interaction is 0.09 (SE = 0.03) in column 4. Star rating remains a strong predictor, with a coefficient of 0.42 (SE = 0.02) across all specifications, but it does not tell the whole story. R-squared rises from 0.31 to 0.47 across the columns. All coefficients are significant at the 1% level except the interaction, which is significant at the 5% level.\n```"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1878, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1496, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1878}, "output_tokens": 2, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "19b6103d-cbfc-505f-8dc1-c40cc8379cf6", "uuid": "f3f41bdd-b3ac-4144-8094-c73e79b9c8a5", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T19:17:35.619Z", "request_id": "req_011Cg6TGyX2tXuCCgxsR6yFW"}
